          "content": "# Project by Saint Sauveur N'Guessan\n\nProfessional n8n multi-agent project built with AVA CEO orchestration and specialized worker agents.\n\nProject areas: AI agents, n8n workflows, Make.com automation, Python, AWS, WhatsApp Business API, PostgreSQL and business process automation.\n\nSafety: workflows are inactive by default. Configure credentials and require human approval before any email, WhatsApp, calendar, Slack or CRM write action."
